        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Saulo Ribeiro, Royler Gracie, Helio Gracie, Vinicius \"Draculino\" Magalhães\n- Organizations: Gracie Humaitá\n- Places: Rio de Janeiro\n- Topics: Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu instruction\n\nFacts:\n- Helio Gracie taught at Gracie Humaitá and ran the Gracie Humaitá school in Rio de Janeiro.\n- Royler Gracie was a student of Helio Gracie.\n- Saulo Ribeiro was trained in Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu by Vinicius \"Draculino\" Magalhães.\n- Vinicius \"Draculino\" Magalhães was a student of Royler Gracie.",
